    "type": 0,
    "content": "https://www.peuresearchcenter.com/ is the place to go for farming data, with details on each farm, and estimated profits. The specific profits of a farm are located on the benchmarks page. Right now, the most profitable farms are gathering in Lake Doric (with gathering glyphs that you won't have so I'm ignoring this), the Bitterfrost Frontier farm (a forgotten LWS3 map that has managed to hold up), and Drizzlewood Coast, from the new Icebrood Saga.\n\nGeneral benchmarks for a \"good\" gold farm are making ~15g/hr. To achieve this, see the \"about benchmarks\" page for specific account unlocks and boosters which will help.",
