    "type": 0,
    "content": "The main things to ensure success in a gold farm are to stick with the commander, and tag as many events and mobs as possible for max loot. It is also very important to have maxed out the masteries of the world zone you're in so the exp turns into spirit shards, which is more gold in your pocket.\nWhen it comes to finding farms, there are usually ample groups in LFG, just pick the map you want!\nHappy farming and may riches be upon you!",
