    "type": 0,
    "content": "A great laid-back way to make some gold. General notes are to be speedy and tag lots of mobs while sticking to you tag and doing what they ask.\nMore detailed notes including builds and booster can be found here:\nhttps://metabattle.com/wiki/Guide:Quick_Guide_to_Lab_Farming\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1kNoF1Hx0WueB188dVtTuJQmy8KBdrHnSY3-N9RFC8SA/edit\n\nHappy farming!",
